{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">曾因在經典無綫劇集《十兄弟》中飾演「順風耳」而為人熟知的林景弘（前名：林遠迎），近年轉戰內地發展並淡出幕前，與家人共同代理醬香型白酒，主要負責港澳及外地市場的推廣與運作。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"659913d4-f340-42c3-9afe-828eee656d04.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026uOmLGebpv51789465161.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"659913d4-f340-42c3-9afe-828eee656d04.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">林景弘曾憶述，當年監製認為他的耳朵「有點兜」，便順理成章安排他飾演「順風耳」一角。回顧當年，該劇曾創下TVB第二高的收視紀錄，至今仍有許多觀眾能憑這個經典角色認出他。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"391da263-d8aa-4f5f-b921-ee3b3122d6b1.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026UAgSrN5eHP1789465161.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"391da263-d8aa-4f5f-b921-ee3b3122d6b1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"374a5166-255d-4589-a3b2-e221c44d324f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026vVp80368UW1789465161.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"374a5166-255d-4589-a3b2-e221c44d324f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日前，林景弘正式於抖音開設個人帳戶，並發布了一條返回家鄉福建的短片，同時宣佈日後會多拍片與大家記錄生活。從片中所見，現年48歲的他樣貌與身材均保養得宜，比起當年更添了一份成熟穩重的男人味，可謂狀態大勇。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">短片曝光後吸引大批昔日劇迷與網民留言支持，紛紛激讚他凍齡有術，留言大讚「型過以前」及「依然咁英氣，期待你再演戲！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T09:59:56.039227+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}